section.subsection:
A qualified taxpayer may claim a nonrefundable tax credit against tax otherwise due under this chapter:

in an amount equal to:
$15,000, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2021;
$13,500, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2022;
$12,000, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2023;
$10,500, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2024;
$9,000, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2025;
$7,500, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2026;
$6,000, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2027;
$4,500, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2028;
$3,000, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2029; and
$1,500, if the qualified purchase occurs during calendar year 2030; and
if the qualified taxpayer certifies under oath that over 50% of the miles that the heavy duty vehicle that is the subject of the qualified purchase will travel annually will be within the state.
